      "content": "thanks for the advice. i already drank a big glass of water and i'm sitting down now. i don't really want to deal with the hassle of a doctor visit or the ER unless i absolutely have to, it's so expensive and slow. do you think it's safe to just wait a few days and see if it happens again? i feel fine otherwise, just a little bit of a headache.",
