      "content": "i get that, but honestly my doctor is so hard to get an appointment with and i really don't want to go to the hospital for something that was probably just a dizzy spell. i'm feeling a lot better now that i've rested. wouldn't it be okay to just take some aspirin and maybe an electrolyte drink for a couple days to see if that fixes it? i'd rather just handle it myself if possible.",
